+# defect_insertion
+
+Target asset: `253b_final_paper/tex_docs/figures/defect_insertion.pdf`
+
+Policy route: hand-drawn and scanned according to the frozen register.
+
+Required content:
+- Draw a spacetime slice with a codimension-`q+1` defect supported on a
+  submanifold.
+- Label the defect operator `U_g(\Sigma^{d-q-1})` or the notation used in the
+  final generalized-symmetry subsection.
+- Show a charged operator linking or crossing the defect.
+- Caption should explain that the defect measures the generalized-symmetry
+  charge.
+
