+\begin{tabular}{@{}p{0.20\linewidth}p{0.27\linewidth}p{0.34\linewidth}@{}}
+\hline
+Category & What is topological & Representative observables \\
+\hline
+Strict TQFT &
+Metric-independent exact theory &
+Wilson-link phases, knot data, Hilbert spaces on closed surfaces \\
+\hline
+Topological term in local QFT &
+Protected response after the gap and IR limit are assumed &
+Hall conductance, edge anomaly coefficient, torus degeneracy \\
+\hline
+Topological sector observable &
+Global sector is topological, but the surrounding theory has local dynamics &
+Instanton number, $\chi_t$, theta dependence, monopole charge \\
+\hline
+Experimental proxy &
+Measurement accesses an effective or model-dependent consequence &
+Interferometer phase shifts, neutron EDM bounds, axion searches, monopole limits \\
+\hline
+\end{tabular}
+\end{center}
+\endgroup
