+# anomaly_inflow
+
+Target asset: `253b_final_paper/tex_docs/figures/anomaly_inflow.pdf`
+
+Policy route: hand-drawn and scanned according to the frozen register.
+
+Required content:
+- Draw a bulk region with boundary and a single chiral boundary direction.
+- Label bulk contribution `delta S_bulk`.
+- Label boundary anomaly `delta S_boundary`.
+- Show cancellation:
+  `delta S_bulk + delta S_boundary = 0`.
+- Use the same sign convention as the final inflow equation in the text.
+
+Verification note: this overlaps with `F-inflow-edge`; keep only one final
+asset if the seven-section paper consolidates the figure.
