+# F-anyon-braid
+
+Target asset: `253b_final_paper/tex_docs/figures/f_anyon_braid.pdf`
+
+Policy route: hand-drawn and scanned. The policy reserves anyon worldlines and
+braid traces for hand drawing.
+
+Required content:
+- Draw spacetime with time vertical and two quasiparticle worldlines.
+- Left panel: one exchange, labeled phase `exp(i pi/m)` for Laughlin
+  quasiholes.
+- Right panel: full monodromy, labeled phase `exp(2 pi i/m)`.
+- Make clear that exchange is half of the full winding.
