+# anyon_braiding
+
+Target asset: `253b_final_paper/tex_docs/figures/anyon_braiding.pdf`
+
+Policy route: hand-drawn and scanned. Anyon worldline braids are explicitly
+reserved for hand drawing.
+
+Required content:
+- Draw two worldlines exchanging in 2+1d spacetime.
+- Label time direction.
+- Label the exchange phase and distinguish it from a full winding when useful.
+- Caption should connect the braid to the anyon statistics subsection.
